mpare A's technical competence to B's. B has stress handling, conscientiousness, weather assessment, computer skills. A has anticipation, complex connections, spatial vision, leadership but also unorganized, not open to new ideas. So we can argue that B remains stronger overall.\n\nThus we will respond: I appreciate the request, I note that we have no stress resilience evidence for A, and his technical competence is strong but not enough to outweigh B's proven stress handling and reliability. Therefore I maintain my recommendation for Candidate B.\n\nWe need to include vote in METADATA_JSON: \"Candidate B\".\n\nProceed."}
